{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37448","headline":"奉使岐下闻唐弘夫行军爲贼所擒伤而有作 · 唐彦谦","name":"奉使岐下闻唐弘夫行军爲贼所擒伤而有作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"报国捐躯实壮夫，楚囚垂欲复神都。\n云台画像皆何者，青史书名或不孤。\n散卒半随袁校尉，寡妻休问辟司徒。\n闻君败绩无归计，气激星辰坐向隅。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"唐彦谦","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37448.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37448","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}